{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01223",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.65,
      "end_seconds": 3.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.75,
      "end_seconds": 10.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.55,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.89,
      "end_seconds": 15.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a cough at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.15,
      "end_seconds": 18.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 19.07,
      "end_seconds": 25.68,
      "duration_seconds": 6.61,
      "text": "Four weeks, I think... sorry, one week, I got that wrong."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.49,
      "end_seconds": 31.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.3,
      "end_seconds": 35.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "It's mild, honestly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.03,
      "end_seconds": 39.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.94,
      "end_seconds": 57.87,
      "duration_seconds": 17.93,
      "text": "It usually comes with sneezing a lot. I've had itchy eyes too, for three weeks. Actually, with itchy eyes, it sort of comes and goes. The sneezing a lot? That's been for six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.53,
      "end_seconds": 61.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.15,
      "end_seconds": 70.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.08,
      "end_seconds": 96.06,
      "duration_seconds": 7.98,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 16, oxygen saturation is 99 percent. And blood pressure 125 over 75, heart rate 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 98.59,
      "end_seconds": 101.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.51,
      "end_seconds": 106.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Alright, tell me if that's sore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.4,
      "end_seconds": 121.15,
      "duration_seconds": 7.75,
      "text": "I can hear a faint wheeze at the end of breathing out, otherwise the chest is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.02,
      "end_seconds": 127.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "That's the examination finished. And fever, any of that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.86,
      "end_seconds": 130.45,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "No. No fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.34,
      "end_seconds": 134.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "And what about chest pain or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.37,
      "end_seconds": 141.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.83,
      "text": "No chest pain or weight loss, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.73,
      "end_seconds": 144.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Is your digestion otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 145.39,
      "end_seconds": 147.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.39,
      "end_seconds": 151.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.39,
      "text": "A few questions about your lifestyle now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.44,
      "end_seconds": 175.4,
      "duration_seconds": 18.96,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I only drink at family occasions. My husband and I live above the shop. I walk the dog every morning. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.47,
      "end_seconds": 178.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 180.64,
      "end_seconds": 185.2,
      "duration_seconds": 4.56,
      "text": "Asthma, for about a year. I've had eczema, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 185.78,
      "end_seconds": 187.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Any other things?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.1,
      "end_seconds": 194.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.98,
      "text": "Yes, asthma is known to us, good to have that clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.46,
      "end_seconds": 207.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Right, which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.62,
      "end_seconds": 217.89,
      "duration_seconds": 8.27,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. Cetirizine. I take it 10 milligrams, when it flares."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.19,
      "end_seconds": 218.89,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.33,
      "end_seconds": 230.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.59,
      "end_seconds": 237.92,
      "duration_seconds": 6.33,
      "text": "I had a mole taken off my arm a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.11,
      "end_seconds": 243.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "Has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 244.87,
      "end_seconds": 249.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Yes, nickel. I get a rash on my skin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.56,
      "end_seconds": 264.0,
      "duration_seconds": 12.44,
      "text": "So, based on the history and the examination, I'm honestly not certain yet. It could be exercise-triggered asthma with seasonal allergy, or it might be a viral chest infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.66,
      "end_seconds": 267.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.71,
      "end_seconds": 282.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.5,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like exercise-triggered asthma with seasonal allergy, but I'd like to confirm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.03,
      "end_seconds": 304.87,
      "duration_seconds": 14.84,
      "text": "An allergy test is what I'd like next, for seasonal symptoms. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. We should do a breathing test for wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 306.88,
      "end_seconds": 307.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Mm, alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.91,
      "end_seconds": 316.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.94,
      "text": "I'll start you on budesonide-formoterol inhaler, 200 micrograms, one puff twice a day, long term. That's for asthma control."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.7,
      "end_seconds": 321.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "How soon will it work?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.57,
      "end_seconds": 340.73,
      "duration_seconds": 18.16,
      "text": "Rinse your mouth after the preventer inhaler and use the spacer. Let's hold off on a peak flow diary for now, and if there's no change in two weeks we can revisit it. I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 342.72,
      "end_seconds": 344.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
}